                    <div class="c-page-header">
                        
                        <h1>Design Academy Eindhoven</h1>
                        <div class="c-page-header__subtitle">Design Academy Eindhoven (DAE) is one of the world’s leading design schools, recognised internationally for its forward-thinking and renowned professors and alumni. Design Academy Eindhoven is a University of the Arts that specializes in Design and is part of the Dutch Universities of Applied Sciences. For over 70 years it has trained aspiring designers to make their mark on the future by thinking freely and openly about what design can achieve, consistently exploring design as an instrument of material, social, environmental and critical innovation. Design Academy’s values — co-participation, care, and pushing discourse forward — guide all aspects of how we work, learn and build community.</div>

