            <div class="u-flex-1 c-card__subtitle">
                Find out more about our Bachelor and Master programmes during an in-person Open Day at DAE. Visitors will have the opportunity to meet current students and staff, see DAE&#39;s  facilities and workshops and ask questions. The Open Day is specifically designed to help you make the right choice when it comes to your future studies! The event will be split into separate groups for each programme.
            </div>
        

        
            <div class="c-card__date">
                24 October 2026
            </div>
        

        
